# Cloudflare Workers Assets redirects — petlifeindia.co
#
# NO www -> apex RULE HERE, AND DO NOT ADD ONE.
#
# Workers Assets only accepts *relative* URLs in this file. A cross-host rule
# such as
#     https://www.petlifeindia.co/*  https://petlifeindia.co/:splat  301
# is rejected at deploy time with "Only relative URLs are allowed [code: 100324]"
# and fails the whole deployment after the assets have already uploaded. (Classic
# Cloudflare Pages did allow it, which is where that pattern comes from.)
#
# Canonicalising www -> apex is done instead with a zone-level Redirect Rule:
#   Cloudflare dashboard -> petlifeindia.co -> Rules -> Redirect Rules
#   When: hostname equals www.petlifeindia.co
#   Then: dynamic redirect to concat("https://petlifeindia.co", http.request.uri.path)
#         status 301, preserve query string
#
# The Supabase submit-form function allows both hosts, so the forms keep working
# either way; the redirect is for canonical SEO and clean analytics.
#
# Same-origin path redirects (e.g. /old-page /new-page 301) are fine to add below.
